@startuml relay-sequence
!theme plain
title TRC WAP Relay - Request Flow

participant "Browser\n(Palm)" as B
participant "PPP software\n(PC)" as P
participant "trc-wap-relay\n(PC)" as X
participant "WAP gateway\n(theretrocenter.com)" as G

== Startup ==
X -> X : resolve gateway host
X -> X : AddIPAddress(165.160.13.20, 165.160.15.20)\non the connection that reaches the gateway
X -> X : bind UDP 165.160.13.20:49300, 165.160.15.20:49300

== Each request ==
B -> P : UDP to 165.160.13.20:49300\n(WTP Invoke + WSP GET)
P -> X : Winsock sendto() - delivered locally
alt first datagram from this peer
  X -> X : new session:\nupstream socket connected to the gateway
end
X -> G : same bytes
G --> X : WTP Result (WBXML page)
X --> P : sendto(peer) from 165.160.13.20:49300
P --> B : reply from the address it called

== Ctrl+C ==
X -> X : DeleteIPAddress for every address it added
@enduml
